{"id":9582,"date":"2025-09-25T12:17:18","date_gmt":"2025-09-25T12:17:18","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/?p=9582"},"modified":"2025-09-25T12:17:18","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T12:17:18","slug":"bed-bug-removal-or-fly-control-in-melbourne-which-pest-is-a-bigger-threat","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/bed-bug-removal-or-fly-control-in-melbourne-which-pest-is-a-bigger-threat\/","title":{"rendered":"Bed Bug Removal or Fly Control in Melbourne \u2013 Which Pest Is a Bigger Threat?"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Across Melbourne, pest problems are a concern for both residents and businesses.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Among the most persistent are <\/span><b>bed bugs<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and <\/span><b>flies<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. These pests are more than an inconvenience\u2014they can affect health, reduce comfort, and cause serious damage to a business\u2019s reputation.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bed bugs are known for disrupting sleep and causing skin irritation, while flies can quickly contaminate food and spread dangerous diseases. Both can create stressful situations at home and costly challenges for schools, hotels, restaurants, and healthcare facilities.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Because of the risks involved, tackling these pests requires the expertise of a <\/span><b>professional pest control service in Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. DIY sprays or traps often provide only temporary relief, while trained technicians use safe and effective methods that deliver long-term results.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Understanding Bed Bugs in Melbourne<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-9585\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-09-25-at-4.04.35-PM-300x300.jpeg\" alt=\"bed bug removal melbourne \n\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-09-25-at-4.04.35-PM-300x300.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-09-25-at-4.04.35-PM-150x150.jpeg 150w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-09-25-at-4.04.35-PM-768x768.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-09-25-at-4.04.35-PM.jpeg 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bed bugs are small, flat insects that feed on human blood. They are reddish-brown in colour and can be difficult to spot due to their size and tendency to hide in dark cracks and crevices. In Melbourne, bed bugs are commonly found in:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Homes and apartments<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hotels and motels<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Backpacker hostels<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Student accommodation<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">They spread easily from one location to another, often by clinging to luggage, clothing, or second-hand furniture. Once they establish themselves, they breed rapidly and can be very difficult to remove.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Signs of a Bed Bug Infestation<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It is important to recognise the early signs of a bed bug problem:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Itchy red bites<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, usually appearing in clusters or lines<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Blood spots<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> on sheets and pillowcases<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Dark faecal marks<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> on mattresses and furniture<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Shed skins<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> or eggs in mattress seams and bed frames<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Because bed bugs hide during the day and emerge at night, infestations often go unnoticed until they are well established. Attempting to control them without professional support usually results in the infestation spreading further.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Health and Safety Risks of Bed Bugs<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bed bugs are not known to transmit diseases, but they cause a range of physical and psychological issues:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Skin irritations and allergic reactions<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Bites can lead to redness, swelling, and discomfort.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Sleep disruption<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Constant itching and the stress of knowing bed bugs are present often lead to restless nights.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Secondary infections<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Scratching the bites can break the skin, creating a risk of bacterial infections.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Psychological stress<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Many people experience anxiety and embarrassment when dealing with a bed bug infestation, especially in shared or public spaces such as hotels.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Understanding Flies in Melbourne<\/span><\/h3>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-9584\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-09-25-at-4.23.59-PM-300x300.jpeg\" alt=\"bed bug removal melbourne \n\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-09-25-at-4.23.59-PM-300x300.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-09-25-at-4.23.59-PM-150x150.jpeg 150w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-09-25-at-4.23.59-PM-768x768.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-09-25-at-4.23.59-PM.jpeg 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Flies are another major pest in Melbourne. They are particularly active in warmer months, though infestations can occur year-round when conditions are right. The most common types of flies in Melbourne include:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Houseflies<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Often found around kitchens, bins, and food preparation areas.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Blowflies<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Large flies that are attracted to decaying organic matter.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Fruit flies<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Small flies commonly seen near ripe or rotting fruit and sugary substances.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Flies thrive in environments where food and waste are accessible, making them especially problematic in restaurants, caf\u00e9s, schools, hospitals, and homes.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Health and Safety Risks of Flies<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Unlike bed bugs, flies are well documented carriers of disease. They spread bacteria and viruses by landing on contaminated surfaces and then transferring pathogens to food and utensils. Some of the main risks include:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Food contamination<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Flies are capable of spreading Salmonella, E. coli, and other dangerous microorganisms.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n<p><\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Public health concerns<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Infestations in schools, healthcare centres, and hospitality venues can cause outbreaks of food-borne illness.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n<p><\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Reputation damage<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: For restaurants, hotels, and catering businesses, even a single fly infestation can lead to complaints, poor reviews, or regulatory penalties.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Comparing Bed Bugs and Flies: Which Is a Bigger Threat?<\/span><\/h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">While both pests are problematic, their impacts differ in several ways:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Health risks<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Bed bugs cause allergic reactions and stress, while flies directly spread disease-causing bacteria.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n<p><\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Comfort and lifestyle impact<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Bed bugs disrupt sleep and mental wellbeing. Flies create visible hygiene issues and food safety concerns.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n<p><\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Business consequences<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: A hotel dealing with bed bugs may lose bookings, while a restaurant with a fly problem risks food safety violations and reputation loss.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n<p><\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Mode of spread<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Bed bugs travel through personal belongings and spread between rooms, while flies breed rapidly in food waste and can infest entire buildings.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In short, both pests pose serious but different threats. Neither should be ignored, and both require <\/span><b>professional pest control in Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for proper management.<\/span><\/p>\n<h5><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Professional Bed Bug Removal in Melbourne<\/span><\/h5>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Because bed bugs are resilient, only specialist methods are truly effective. Common approaches include:<\/span><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Heat treatment<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Using high temperatures to kill all stages of bed bugs, including eggs.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n<p><\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Chemical treatment<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Applying approved insecticides in targeted areas where bed bugs hide.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n<p><\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Ongoing monitoring<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Following up with inspections and preventive strategies to ensure the infestation does not return.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Working with licensed experts provides peace of mind and ensures the infestation is eliminated safely and thoroughly.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For a truly effective solution, professional <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/bed-bug-treatment\/\"><b>Bed Bug Removal in Melbourne<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is essential. Licensed pest control experts use proven methods to eradicate infestations, protect your home or business, and implement preventive measures to stop bed bugs from returning. Whether in residential properties, hotels, or schools, choosing professional services ensures safety, hygiene, and long-term peace of mind.<\/span><\/p>\n<h6><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Professional Fly Control in Melbourne<\/span><\/h6>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Effective fly management requires a combination of control and prevention:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Traps and fly baits<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to reduce adult populations.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Residual sprays<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> applied in key areas to prevent reinfestation.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Hygiene management<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> such as proper waste storage and food handling practices.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Preventive measures<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> including fly screens and sealed entry points.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Professional<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/fly-control\/\"> <b>Fly Control in Melbourne<\/b> <\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">ensures that fly infestations are managed efficiently and safely. By combining targeted treatments with preventive measures and hygiene practices, licensed pest control experts can protect homes, schools, hospitality venues, and healthcare facilities from recurring problems. Choosing professional services guarantees a cleaner, healthier, and fly-free environment.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Why Choose 7 States Pest Control in Melbourne<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When selecting a pest control provider, experience and professionalism are key. Benefits of working with a trusted team include:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A licensed and highly trained workforce<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Specialist knowledge of bed bug and fly infestations<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Eco-friendly treatments designed to protect families, children, and pets<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Fast response, detailed inspections, and ongoing preventive plans<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bed bugs and flies present very different but equally serious challenges for Melbourne homes and businesses. Bed bugs cause ongoing discomfort, sleepless nights, and psychological stress, while flies spread disease and threaten food safety.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Attempting to manage these pests without professional help is rarely successful. Instead, working with an experienced<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/\"> <b>pest control service in Melbourne<\/b> <\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">ensures effective, safe, and long-lasting results.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Book expert bed bug removal and fly control in Melbourne today to protect your home, school, or hospitality facility.<\/b><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Across Melbourne, pest problems are a concern for both residents and businesses.\u00a0 Among the most persistent are bed bugs and flies. These pests are more than an inconvenience\u2014they can affect health, reduce comfort, and cause serious damage to a business\u2019s reputation. Bed bugs are known for disrupting sleep and causing skin irritation, while flies can [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":9583,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[22],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-9582","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-bed-bug-removal-melbourne"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v25.4 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Bed Bug &amp; Fly Pest Control Services in Melbourne<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Professional bed bug removal and fly control in Melbourne. Protect homes, schools, and hospitality venues with safe, effective pest control.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/bed-bug-removal-or-fly-control-in-melbourne-which-pest-is-a-bigger-threat\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Bed Bug &amp; Fly Pest Control Services in Melbourne\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Professional bed bug removal and fly control in Melbourne. Protect homes, schools, and hospitality venues with safe, effective pest control.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/bed-bug-removal-or-fly-control-in-melbourne-which-pest-is-a-bigger-threat\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-09-25T12:17:18+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-09-25-at-4.23.35-PM-2.jpeg\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1280\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"672\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/jpeg\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"6 minutes\" \/>\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/bed-bug-removal-or-fly-control-in-melbourne-which-pest-is-a-bigger-threat\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/bed-bug-removal-or-fly-control-in-melbourne-which-pest-is-a-bigger-threat\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"7 States Pest Control\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/#\/schema\/person\/d2eebd8e6e8b6f07170a10bc11d3dadb\"},\"headline\":\"Bed Bug Removal or Fly Control in Melbourne \u2013 Which Pest Is a Bigger Threat?\",\"datePublished\":\"2025-09-25T12:17:18+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/bed-bug-removal-or-fly-control-in-melbourne-which-pest-is-a-bigger-threat\/\"},\"wordCount\":1094,\"commentCount\":0,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/#organization\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/bed-bug-removal-or-fly-control-in-melbourne-which-pest-is-a-bigger-threat\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-09-25-at-4.23.35-PM-2.jpeg\",\"articleSection\":[\"bed bug removal Melbourne\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/bed-bug-removal-or-fly-control-in-melbourne-which-pest-is-a-bigger-threat\/\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/7states